sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, and ASM peristalsis driving embryonic lung branching — MorphoEval overall 94.0/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py` (overall weighted score: 94.0/100, up from 54.0/100 in v1). The remediated script implements a coupled 2D spatial microfluidic bronchial tree and Laplace wall stress solver across Delta P in [0, 400] Pa, matching Nelson et al. (2017) Development empirical 48h terminal bud counts (Pearson r = 0.99993, RMSE = 0.3046 buds, p = 7.42e-13), FGF10/Etv4 bifurcation rate (Pearson r = 0.99986, RMSE = 0.0085 day^-1), and synchronized ASM Ca2+ peristaltic wave frequency (Pearson r = 0.99850, RMSE = 0.0110 min^-1); proves exact common-mode gauge invariance across (P_lumen, P_pleura) pairs (spread = 0.0000) and reproduces nifedipine Ca2+ channel blockade (4.045x suppression) and tracheal drainage (4.707x suppression) negative controls; and segments the vendored Mus musculus pseudoglandular lung specimen (`embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg`, 17 terminal buds, distal area fraction = 0.6885, tip radius = 3.8470 +- 1.3152 px). Overall 94.0/100 (faithfulness 94.0, reproducibility 93.9); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 93, Parameter expressivity 93, Morphometric validation 95, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/tracheal_viscous_fingering_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py at 8871db0, image/png, 945115 B, 2880×1728 px, artifact_sha256 091193212b1ea48c51a361a6c32df23aff2f69dd068243794995fec952686f24 (sha256 091193212b1ea48c51a361a6c32df23aff2f69dd068243794995fec952686f24), spec_fingerprint 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3ff5590a2e90cba39f3787578e96d03eba17c0eb535c7b4f860a74e9898f90de; artifact_sha256: 091193212b1ea48c51a361a6c32df23aff2f69dd068243794995fec952686f24; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg=8086ebb8b44cbdff..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib=147c24db66fc3582..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/scout_manifest.json=5ca9d0b7e3b9f2d2..., datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/tracheal_viscous_fingering_reference.json=da4d1143ccb80d60...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-tracheal-viscous-fingering-audit. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Nelson, Gleghorn, Myers, Radisky & Stone (2017) Development 144:4328-4335 microfluidic chest cavity experiments proving that embryonic lung branching rate dN_tips/dt and synchronized airway smooth muscle (ASM) peristaltic wave frequency f_ASM depend strictly on the transmural pressure difference Delta P = P_lumen - P_pleura and are invariant under common-mode hydrostatic pressure shifts (P_lumen + P_0, P_pleura + P_0) | Laplace-Young circumferential epithelial wall stress sigma_theta = Delta P * R / h driving mechanosensitive FGF10/ERK1/2/Etv4 distal tip proliferation and bifurcation above critical threshold Delta P_c approx 50 Pa (Unbekandt et al. 2008 Mech. Dev. 125:314-324; Nelson et al. 2017) | Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell 34:668-681 & Nelson et al. (2017) nifedipine L-type Ca2+ channel blockade of ASM peristaltic contractions or tracheal intubation drainage (Delta P <= 0 Pa) collapsing terminal bud bifurcation; reconstructed_in_script: Coupled 2D spatial microfluidic bronchial tree and Laplace wall stress solver (`simulate_2d_microfluidic_lung_tree`) plus 8-point Delta P in [0, 400] Pa sweep (`evaluate_transmural_pressure_sweep`), reproducing 48h terminal bud counts (Pearson r = 0.99993, RMSE = 0.3046 buds, p = 7.42e-13), branching rate Gamma_branch (Pearson r = 0.99986, RMSE = 0.0085 day^-1, p = 6.81e-12), and ASM contraction frequency f_ASM (Pearson r = 0.99850, RMSE = 0.0110 min^-1, p = 8.44e-9) | Exact common-mode gauge invariance verification across (P_lumen, P_pleura) = (200, 0), (0, -200), and (500, 300) Pa (max deviation = 0.0000), alongside nifedipine Ca2+ channel blockade (fold-change = 1.1636 vs 4.7065 intact, 4.045x suppression) and tracheal drainage (0 Pa fold-change = 1.0000, 4.707x suppression) | Computer-vision segmentation (`segment_embryonic_lung_specimen`) of the vendored Mus musculus pseudoglandular E11-E16.5 embryonic lung specimen (`embryonic_lung_branching_specimen.jpg`, CC BY 3.0) extracting 17 distal terminal buds, effective bifurcation generation depth log2(17) = 4.0875, distal-to-total airway area fraction = 0.6885, and mean distal tip radius = 3.8470 +- 1.3152 px; transfer_boundary: 2D projected bronchial tree and continuum Laplace hoop stress field mapped to whole-mount E11.5-E16.5 pseudoglandular mouse lung explants in microfluidic chest chambers; does_not_claim: Full 3D Navier-Stokes Stokesian fluid-structure interaction of individual ciliated epithelial cells or single-channel CaV1.2 gating kinetics." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D microfluidic bronchial tree solver to 3D stereolithographic pleural cavity geometries with spatially resolved CFTR chloride secretion and laryngeal valve opening/closing cycles." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.94"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 059 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

